sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker
    participant P as ClientPool
    participant C1 as Client→Router1
    participant C2 as Client→Router2

    W->>P: Acquire() [start]
    P-->>W: 返回 Client→Router1 (round-robin)
    W->>C1: StartTransaction
    C1-->>W: txID
    W->>C1: Read(txID, key)
    W->>C1: Write(txID, key, val)
    W->>C1: Commit(txID)
    Note over W,C1: 事务结束，释放绑定

    W->>P: Acquire() [下一个start]
    P-->>W: 返回 Client→Router2 (round-robin)
    W->>C2: StartTransaction
    C2-->>W: txID